//- index.pug
doctype html
html
  include includes/head.pug
  body
    nav#intro
      .nav__content
        a.nav__title.nav__title--desktop.text--large(href="#intro")  Daniel Hearn
        a.nav__title.nav__title--mobile.text--large(href="#intro")  Dan Hearn
        div.nav__links
          a.text--small(href="#work") work
          a.text--small(href="#about") about
          a.text--small(href="/blog/") blog
    main
      section.container.intro
        h1.text--medium
          | Hi, I'm Dan — a Senior Software Engineer at 
          a.link(href=links.freshrelevance) Dotdigital.
      #content
        section.container.experience
          h3.text--large.heading Senior Software Engineer at Dotdigital (Fresh Relevance)
          h2.text--medium.sub-heading July 2020 – Present
          p.text--small
            | I build and maintain front-end interfaces in React, Redux, and TypeScript,
            | while also contributing to backend work in Python and Node. My role covers
            | feature delivery, technical improvements, mentoring Junior developers, and support for customer-facing issues
            | across connected product areas.
          p.text--small
            | Recent work includes the Testing & Optimization management, Site Info Bar, SmartBlock
            | Builder, reporting tools, product management features, and UI refresh projects.
          p.text--small
            | I also support the client scripting team on time-critical issues and have mentored
            | placement students.
          p.text--small
            | During this period, I have progressed from Junior Engineer to Senior Software Engineer.
        section.container.experience
          h3.text--large.heading Placement at Fresh Relevance
          h2.text--medium.sub-heading July 2018 – May 2019
          p.text--small
            | I integrated Fresh Relevance's platform with clients' e-commerce sites, built
            | React-based interfaces, and improved backend data processing.
        section.container.experience
          h3.text--large.heading University of Portsmouth
          h2.text--medium.sub-heading Sept 2016 – May 2020
          p.text--small
            | I graduated with a First Class Honours in BSc Computer Science and received the
            | British Computer Society Prize for Best Final Year Student at Portsmouth.
          p.text--small
            | For my final-year project, I built an Internet of Things climate monitoring system
            | with a web app for viewing environmental data. The project used Raspberry Pi,
            | microcontrollers, radio modules, sensors, batteries, Vue, Python (Flask), and SQLite.
        section.container.projects#work
          h3.text--large Personal Projects
          section.grid.grid--2
            each project in projects
              include includes/project.pug
        section.container.about#about
          .about__content.grid-item--col-1-3
            h3.text--large About Me
            p.text--small
              | I publish personal project work on 
              a.link(href=links.github) GitHub
              | .
            p.text--small
              | I'm proficient in React, Typescript, Python (Django, Flask), Node, Vue;
              | while using Copilot, MCPs, Webpack, Gulp, Git, in my workflow. 
              | Additionally, I have experience with SQL and MongoDB.
            p.text--small
              | I write about board games and video games on 
              a.text--small.link(href="/blog/") my blog
              | .
      section.container.footer
        div
          a.text--small(href=links.github) Github
          a.text--small(href=links.email) Email
          a.text--small(href=links.blog) Blog
  include includes/footer.pug